---
import Layout from "../../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Setting Up Your First Rust Server - QuackHost Blog">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 lg:py-16">
    <!-- Article Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-cyan-50/20 text-cyan-50 text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase">Tutorial</span>
        <span class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">January 12, 2025 • 9 min read</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Setting Up Your First Rust Server: Complete Walkthrough
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
        Launch your own Rust server in under 10 minutes with this step-by-step guide. From server creation to mod installation, we'll cover everything you need to get started.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Featured Image Placeholder -->
    <div class="mb-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-2xl h-96 flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-gray-80">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-8xl mb-4">⚡</div>
        <p class="text-cool-gray-40 text-lg">Rust Server Setup Guide</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Article Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">

      <!-- Introduction -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Rust is one of the most demanding yet rewarding survival games to host. Whether you're setting up a server for friends or building a community, this guide will walk you through the entire process from start to finish.
        </p>
        <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          By the end of this tutorial, you'll have a fully functional Rust server with custom settings, mods, and optimizations for the best player experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Prerequisites -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#FF9C20]">1.</span> Prerequisites
        </h2>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-cyan-50 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">What You'll Need</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-cool-gray-20">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-cyan-50 mt-1">✓</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">QuackHost Account:</strong> Sign up for free at quackhost.com</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-cyan-50 mt-1">✓</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">Server Plan:</strong> Minimum Duck plan (4GB RAM) recommended for 10-20 players</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-cyan-50 mt-1">✓</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">15 Minutes:</strong> That's all it takes to get your server running</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">📊 Rust Server Requirements</h3>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-gray-80">
                  <th class="py-3 pr-4 text-white font-semibold">Players</th>
                  <th class="py-3 pr-4 text-white font-semibold">RAM</th>
                  <th class="py-3 pr-4 text-white font-semibold">CPU</th>
                  <th class="py-3 text-white font-semibold">Recommended Plan</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="text-cool-gray-20">
                <tr class="border-b border-gray-90">
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">5-10</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">4GB</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">2 cores</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-cyan-50 font-semibold">Duck</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-gray-90">
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">10-50</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">8GB</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">4 cores</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-cyan-50 font-semibold">Goose</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-gray-90">
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">50-100</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">16GB</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">6 cores</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-cyan-50 font-semibold">Swan</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">100+</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">32GB+</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4">8+ cores</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-cyan-50 font-semibold">Flock</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Step 1: Create Server -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#FF9C20]">2.</span> Creating Your Rust Server
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Step-by-Step Server Creation</h3>

            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FF9C20] text-black font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Log into QuackPlane</h4>
                  <p class="text-cool-gray-20">Navigate to panel.quackhost.com and sign in with your credentials.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FF9C20] text-black font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Select "Create Server"</h4>
                  <p class="text-cool-gray-20">Click the "Create New Server" button in your dashboard.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FF9C20] text-black font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Choose Rust</h4>
                  <p class="text-cool-gray-20 mb-3">Select "Rust" from the game server options.</p>
                  <div class="bg-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <p class="text-cyan-50 text-sm font-mono">Game Type: Rust → Server Edition: Vanilla or Oxide/uMod</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FF9C20] text-black font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Select Server Location</h4>
                  <p class="text-cool-gray-20">Choose a data center closest to your players for best performance.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FF9C20] text-black font-bold flex items-center justify-center">5</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Configure Server Name</h4>
                  <p class="text-cool-gray-20">Give your server a memorable name (you can change this later).</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FF9C20] text-black font-bold flex items-center justify-center">6</div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Deploy</h4>
                  <p class="text-cool-gray-20">Click "Create Server" and wait 2-3 minutes for automatic setup.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50/10 to-purple-50/10 border-2 border-cyan-50/50 rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-white">
              <strong class="text-cyan-50">💡 Pro Tip:</strong> Choose "Oxide/uMod" if you plan to install plugins. Vanilla is best for pure Rust experience.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Step 2: Basic Configuration -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#FF9C20]">3.</span> Basic Server Configuration
        </h2>

        <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-lg mb-6">
          Once your server is created, it's time to configure the essential settings.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Server Settings File</h3>

          <p class="text-cool-gray-20 mb-4">Navigate to Files → <code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded text-cyan-50">server.cfg</code></p>

          <div class="bg-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-6 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto">
            <div class="text-cool-gray-40 mb-2"># server.cfg - Basic Rust Server Configuration</div>
            <div class="space-y-1 text-cool-gray-20">
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.hostname</span> <span class="text-purple-50">"My Awesome Rust Server"</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.description</span> <span class="text-purple-50">"Friendly community server - All welcome!"</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.headerimage</span> <span class="text-purple-50">"https://yoursite.com/header.png"</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.url</span> <span class="text-purple-50">"https://yoursite.com"</span></div>
              <div class="text-cool-gray-40 mt-4 mb-2"># Player Limits</div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.maxplayers</span> <span class="text-green-50">50</span></div>
              <div class="text-cool-gray-40 mt-4 mb-2"># Map Settings</div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.seed</span> <span class="text-green-50">12345</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Procedural map seed</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.worldsize</span> <span class="text-green-50">3500</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># 3500 recommended for 50 players</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.saveinterval</span> <span class="text-green-50">600</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Save every 10 minutes</span></div>
              <div class="text-cool-gray-40 mt-4 mb-2"># Gameplay Settings</div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.pve</span> <span class="text-green-50">false</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Set to true for PVE mode</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">decay.scale</span> <span class="text-green-50">1.0</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Base decay rate</span></div>
              <div class="text-cool-gray-40 mt-4 mb-2"># RCON Settings (for admin access)</div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">rcon.password</span> <span class="text-purple-50">"yourSecurePassword123"</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">rcon.web</span> <span class="text-green-50">1</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">🗺️ World Size Guidelines</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#FF9C20] mt-1">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">2500:</strong> Small map, 10-25 players, faster action</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#FF9C20] mt-1">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">3500:</strong> Medium map, 25-50 players, balanced gameplay</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#FF9C20] mt-1">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">4500:</strong> Large map, 50-100 players, exploration focus</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#FF9C20] mt-1">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">5500+:</strong> Huge map, 100+ players, epic scale (requires Swan/Flock plan)</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Step 3: Installing Plugins -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#FF9C20]">4.</span> Installing Plugins with uMod
        </h2>

        <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-lg mb-6">
          Plugins add powerful features to your Rust server. Here's how to install the most popular ones.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Quick Plugin Installation</h3>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-cyan-50 mb-3">Method 1: QuackPlane Plugin Manager (Easiest)</h4>
              <ol class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20 list-decimal list-inside">
                <li>Navigate to Plugins tab in QuackPlane</li>
                <li>Search for plugin name (e.g., "Admin Radar")</li>
                <li>Click "Install" → Server automatically restarts</li>
              </ol>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-cyan-50 mb-3">Method 2: Manual Installation</h4>
              <ol class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20 list-decimal list-inside">
                <li>Download plugin from umod.org</li>
                <li>Navigate to Files → <code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded text-cyan-50">oxide/plugins/</code></li>
                <li>Upload the .cs file</li>
                <li>Restart server or type <code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded text-cyan-50">oxide.reload PluginName</code> in console</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-purple-50 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">🔌 Essential Plugins for New Servers</h3>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-50 pl-4">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Admin Radar</h4>
              <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-2">ESP and admin tools for server management</p>
              <a href="https://umod.org/plugins/admin-radar" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-50 text-sm hover:underline">umod.org/plugins/admin-radar →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="border-l-4 border-cyan-50 pl-4">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Kits</h4>
              <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-2">Create starter kits, VIP kits, and custom item sets</p>
              <a href="https://umod.org/plugins/kits" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-50 text-sm hover:underline">umod.org/plugins/kits →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="border-l-4 border-green-50 pl-4">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Teleportation</h4>
              <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-2">Home, warp, and teleport features</p>
              <a href="https://umod.org/plugins/nteleportation" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-50 text-sm hover:underline">umod.org/plugins/nteleportation →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="border-l-4 border-[#FF9C20] pl-4">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Stack Size Controller</h4>
              <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-2">Adjust stack sizes for custom gameplay</p>
              <a href="https://umod.org/plugins/stack-size-controller" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-50 text-sm hover:underline">umod.org/plugins/stack-size-controller →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-50 pl-4">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Economics</h4>
              <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-2">Currency system for your server economy</p>
              <a href="https://umod.org/plugins/economics" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-50 text-sm hover:underline">umod.org/plugins/economics →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Step 4: Server Management -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#FF9C20]">5.</span> Server Management Basics
        </h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>🎮</span> Starting Your Server
            </h3>
            <ol class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20 list-decimal list-inside text-sm">
              <li>Go to QuackPlane dashboard</li>
              <li>Click "Start" button</li>
              <li>Wait 2-3 minutes for full startup</li>
              <li>Server appears in Rust server list</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>⏹️</span> Stopping Your Server
            </h3>
            <ol class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20 list-decimal list-inside text-sm">
              <li>Click "Stop" in dashboard</li>
              <li>Wait for graceful shutdown</li>
              <li>All progress is auto-saved</li>
              <li>Players receive disconnect message</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>🔄</span> Restarting Your Server
            </h3>
            <ol class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20 list-decimal list-inside text-sm">
              <li>Click "Restart" button</li>
              <li>Or use console: <code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded text-cyan-50 text-xs">quit</code></li>
              <li>Automatic wipes handled by schedule</li>
              <li>Config changes take effect</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>📊</span> Monitoring Performance
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-cyan-50">•</span>
                <span>CPU & RAM usage in dashboard</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-cyan-50">•</span>
                <span>Player count and ping</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-cyan-50">•</span>
                <span>Console logs for errors</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-cyan-50">•</span>
                <span>Performance graphs over time</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">🛠️ Essential Admin Commands</h3>

          <div class="bg-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-6 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto">
            <div class="space-y-3 text-cool-gray-20">
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">server.save</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Manually save the server</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">oxide.reload PluginName</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Reload a plugin</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">ownerid "steamid64" "playername"</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Make player owner</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">moderatorid "steamid64" "playername"</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Make player moderator</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">ban "playername" "reason"</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Ban a player</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">kick "playername" "reason"</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Kick a player</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">env.time 12</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Set time to noon</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">weather.rain 0</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Disable rain</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-cyan-50">fps.limit 60</span> <span class="text-cool-gray-40"># Limit server FPS</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Wipe Schedule -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#FF9C20]">6.</span> Setting Up Wipe Schedule
        </h2>

        <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-lg mb-6">
          Rust servers require periodic wipes to maintain performance and fairness. Here's how to configure automatic wipes.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Recommended Wipe Schedules</h3>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-gray-100 border-l-4 border-cyan-50 p-4 rounded">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Weekly Wipes (Most Popular)</h4>
              <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-2">Full wipe every Thursday at server restart</p>
              <ul class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm space-y-1">
                <li>• Best for high-activity servers</li>
                <li>• Keeps gameplay fresh</li>
                <li>• Matches official Rust updates</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-100 border-l-4 border-purple-50 p-4 rounded">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Bi-Weekly Wipes</h4>
              <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-2">Full wipe every other Thursday</p>
              <ul class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm space-y-1">
                <li>• Good for medium-pop servers</li>
                <li>• More time for base building</li>
                <li>• Blueprint wipes monthly</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-100 border-l-4 border-green-50 p-4 rounded">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Monthly Wipes (Required)</h4>
              <p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-2">Forced wipe first Thursday of each month</p>
              <ul class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm space-y-1">
                <li>• Mandatory Facepunch update</li>
